e. melakukan mediasi atas sengketa pelanggaran hak anak; f. melakukan kerja sama dengan lembaga yang dibentuk masyarakat di bidang perlindungan anak;

g. memberikan laporan pada pihak berwajib tentang adanya dugaan pelanggaran terhadap Undang-Undang Perlindungan Anak; dan h . tugas lain sesuai dengan ketentuan Peraturan Perundang-undangan.

(2) Ketentuan lebih lanjut mengenai Komisi Perlindungan Anak Daerah diatur dengan Peraturan W ali kota.

translated_text:
Article 83

(1) The Regional Child Protection Commission has the following duties: a. supervising the implementation of child protection and fulfillment of children's rights;

b. providing input and proposals in the formulation of policies regarding the implementation of child protection;

c. collecting data and information on child protection; d. receiving and conducting reviews of community complaints regarding violations of children's rights;

JDIH Kota Singkawang

e. conducting mediation on disputes regarding violations of children's rights; f. cooperating with institutions established by the community in the field of child protection;

g. providing reports to the authorities regarding alleged violations of the Child Protection Law; and h. other tasks in accordance with the provisions of Laws and Regulations.

(2) Further provisions regarding the Regional Child Protection Commission shall be regulated by Mayor's Regulation.

text:
Pasal 87

Pengembangan KLA diarahkan pada pemenuhan hak anak yang meliputi: a . hak sipil dan kebebasan;

b. lingkungan keluarga dan pengasuhan alternatif;

c. kesehatan dasar dan kesejahteraan; d . pendidikan, pemanfaatan waktu luang, dan kegiatan budaya; dan e . perlindungan khusus.

translated_text:
Article 87

The development of KLA is directed at the fulfillment of children's rights which include: a . civil rights and freedoms;

b. family environment and alternative care;

c. basic health and welfare; d . education, leisure time utilization, and cultural activities; and e . special protection.

text:
Pasal 88

( 1) Dalam rangka mewujudkan KLA, maka disusun tahapan pengembangan KLA yang meliputi: a . persiapan;

b. perencanaan;

c. pelaksanaan;

d. pemantauan; e . evaluasi; dan

f. pelaporan.

(2) Dalam setiap tahapan pengembangan KLA, wajib mempertimbangkan pandangan anak yang diperoleh melalui konsultasi anak.

translated_text:
Article 88

( 1) In order to realize KLA, stages of KLA development are compiled which include: a . preparation;

b. planning;

c. implementation;

d. monitoring; e . evaluation; and

f. reporting.

(2) In every stage of KLA development, the views of children obtained through child consultation must be considered.

text:
Pasal 90

( 1) Tugas pokok Gugus Tugas KLA adalah sebagai berikut: a . mengkoordinasikan berbagai upaya pengembangan KLA; b. menyusun RAD pembangunan KLA;

c. melaksanakan sosialisasi, advokasi dan komunikasi pengembangan KLA;

d. melakukan pemantauan terhadap pelaksanaan kebijakan, program dan kegiatan dalam RAD pembangunan KLA;

e. melakukan evaluasi setiap akhir tahun terhadap pelaksanaan kebijakan, program dan kegiatan dalam RAD pembangunan KLA; dan f. menyampaikan laporan kepada W ali kota.

(2) Ketentuan lebih lanjut mengenai Gugus Tugas KLA diatur dengan Peraturan W ali kota.

translated_text:
Article 90

( 1) The main tasks of the KLA Task Force are as follows: a . coordinating various KLA development efforts; b. preparing the RAD for KLA development;

c. conducting socialization, advocacy and communication for KLA development;

d. monitoring the implementation of policies, programs and activities in the RAD for KLA development;

e. conducting evaluation at the end of each year on the implementation of policies, programs and activities in the RAD for KLA development; and f. submitting reports to the Mayor.

(2) Further provisions regarding the KLA Task Force are regulated by Mayor's Regulation.

